Russian Defence Minister at the teleconference: Units of Russian Armed Forces have shot down 7 airplanes and 45 drones of Ukrainian army, 109 HIMARS and Olkha rockets launched by the enemy during the referenda hosted in the Lugansk and Donetsk people's republics, as well as at the liberated territories of Kherson and Zaporozhye regions

❕'Thanks to the measures taken, hundreds of lives have been saved and the referenda have been facilitated', stated Sergei Shoigu.

